---
/** DMCs — a quote, line by line; the total is what they receive. */
---
<div class="mk-panel">
  <div class="mk-head"><b>Your quote</b><small>per person · USD</small></div>
  <div class="mk-row plain"><div><b>Offbeat Mara camp · 4 nights</b><small>From your 2026 rate sheet</small></div><span class="r">2,480</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row plain"><div><b>Shared game drives · 4 days</b></div><span class="r">380</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row plain"><div><b>Conservancy fees, flights, transfers</b></div><span class="r">954</span></div>
  <div class="mk-sum"><span class="mk-p">You receive, in full</span><b>USD 3,814</b></div>
  <div class="mk-foot"><span class="mk-fine">Horizon's 10% is added on the agency's side.</span><span class="mk-btn sig">Send quote</span></div>
</div>
